     "<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">Dave,<div><br></div><div>You might also want to make sure the Matrix library is up to date.  I recommend, however, that you do not use the development version of RRPP if it is your tendency to install development versions from GitHub.  That version is currently volatile, thanks to ongoing work to fix an issue imposed by some base R functions.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Mike<br><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>On Oct 29, 2025, at 6:34 PM, &#39;Adams, Dean [EEOB]&#39; via geomorph R package &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Dave,</div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><br></div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">Be sure to install both the latest version of geomorph ANS the latest version of RRPP from CRAN.  </div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><br></div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\">When I do that the code works as intended.</div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><br>Best, </div><div style=\"font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><br>Dean</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><div><pre style=\"margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:13px\">-- \r\n</div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:13px\">Dr. Dean C. Adams</div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:13px\">Distinguished Professor</div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:13px\">Director, Ecology and Evolutionary Biology Graduate Program</div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:13px\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology</div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:13px\">Iowa State University</div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:13px\"><a href=\"https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://www.public.ias